                <pb facs="0433" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg331"/>

                <head>Arbitration convention between the United States and France</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, February 10,
                        1908. Ratification advised by the Senate, February 19, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, February 27, 1908. Ratified by France, March 3, 1908.
                        Ratifications exchanged at Washington, March 12, 1908. Proclaimed, March 14,
                        1908.</hi></p>

